      "result": "## Test Execution Complete ✓\n\nI have successfully executed the comprehensive QA test suite for the niche product recommendation website. Here's the final summary:\n\n### Results Overview\n**Total Tests: 22** | **Passed: 18** | **Failed: 4** | **Completion: 100%**\n\n### Passing Tests (18/22)\n✅ **Functionality:**\n- FT-1: Product creation and editing with all attributes\n- FT-3: Keyword search works for names, descriptions, and tags (case-insensitive)\n- FT-4: Tag filters become available and filter correctly\n- FT-5: New tags on products are saved and filterable\n- FT-6: Tags on existing products can be added/removed\n- FT-7: Products assign to exactly one category\n- FT-8: Category filtering works with accurate counts\n- FT-9: Complete product list browsing with all required data\n- FT-10: Sorting (by rating, price) and filtering (by rating, price) work correctly\n\n✅ **Constraints:**\n- CS-11: Each product belongs to exactly one category\n- CS-12: All displayed results satisfy active search/filter/category/rating criteria\n- CS-22: Invalid product IDs show clear not-found state\n\n✅ **Interaction:**\n- IX-13: Filter/sort changes update products instantly without page reload\n- IX-14: Clicking product name/image opens detail page\n- IX-15: \"Buy Now\" button opens affiliate link in new tab\n- IX-21: Category filter selection updates display immediately\n\n✅ **Content:**\n- CT-16: Product detail pages display all required data correctly\n- CT-17: Seeded products maintain consistent categories and tags across views\n- CT-18: Product data (name, price, category, rating) consistent; detail view shows full review and complete specs\n\n### Critical Issues (4 Failures)\n❌ **FT-2 (Featured Products):** Featured toggle doesn't update the homepage featured section. Only 3 hardcoded products appear.\n\n❌ **FT-19 (Data Persistence):** Products are lost after page reload/revisit. Critical data loss issue indicates missing persistent storage.\n\n❌ **CS-20 (Product Validation):** Form only enforces name, category, and description. Missing validation for required image, affiliate link, full review, and specifications.\n\n### Recommendation\nThe application has solid core functionality for product browsing, searching, filtering, and navigation. However, **critical persistence and validation issues** must be resolved before production use. The data loss after reload and incomplete featured product functionality are significant blockers.",
